  "slug": "tidycoder",
  "name": "Tidycoder",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Janitor mode for Claude Code. Purge regenerable artifacts (node_modules, .next, .turbo, dist, build, caches) from stale projects. Target one repo or scan all subfolders. Never touches source, .env*, configs, or .git.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `tidycoder` (Janitor mode).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install tidycoder@claude-community` from `makerdock/tidy`.\n\nA Claude Code skill that plays janitor — purges regenerable build artifacts (`node_modules`, `.next`, `.turbo`, `dist`, `build`, `out`, `.expo`, framework caches, Python caches, Rust `target`) from projects you haven't touched recently.",
